@host = http://localhost:5287

### Registracija restorana (vlasnik se odmah prijavljuje)
# @name register
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantName": "Demo Bistro",
  "firstName": "Luka",
  "lastName": "Menadžer",
  "email": "vlasnik@demo.rs",
  "password": "lozinka123"
}

### Prijava
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "vlasnik@demo.rs",
  "password": "lozinka123"
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Ko sam ja
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Pozicije restorana
GET {{host}}/api/positions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Poziv za konobara
# @name invite
POST {{host}}/api/invitations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "konobar@demo.rs",
  "role": "Staff"
}

### Poziv: pregled (javno, token iz odgovora iznad)
POST {{host}}/api/invitations/preview
Content-Type: application/json

{ "token": "PASTE_TOKEN" }

### Poziv: prihvatanje
POST {{host}}/api/invitations/accept
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "PASTE_TOKEN",
  "firstName": "Marko",
  "lastName": "Konobar",
  "password": "lozinka123"
}

### Osvežavanje (refresh token je u HttpOnly cookie-ju)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/refresh

### Odjava
POST {{host}}/api/auth/logout
